# Stray personal/business documents and database dumps. These landed in the
# repo root once (employment records, a tax form, a 14MB pg cluster dump) and
# were one `git add -A` away from being published. The repo tracks no PDFs,
# archives or saved HTML, so blanket-ignoring them costs nothing.
# Real documents belong in ~/Documents/personal-docs; dumps in ~/jolly-backups.
# Anchored to the repo ROOT (a leading slash): that is where strays land, and
# an unanchored *.sql would have swallowed the tracked drizzle/ migrations.
/*.pdf
/*.html
/*.gz
/*.zip
/*.backup
/*.dump
/*.sql
/*.csv
/*.xlsx

# incremental build info from tsconfig.tools.json
*.tsbuildinfo
